{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "继第二天之后，我们也平安度过了考试周的第三天。", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……果然还是很累啊」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4092", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理也会感到疲惫啊」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1002", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天的数学考试，全是需要大量计算的题目啊。要是稍微有些需要动脑子的巧妙题目就好了」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": "「今天的数学考试，全是需要大量计算的题目啊。要是稍微有些需要动脑子的巧妙题目就好了」", "plain_idx": 176, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4093", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和我们疲惫的方向不一样……！」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，这下考试就只剩明天了」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0428", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我看到了希望的曙光。明天就是决战的时刻了，安洁！」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "「我看到了希望的曙光。明天就是决战的时刻了，安洁！」", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0379", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是的！您说的没错……」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2163", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「终于……明天……」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2164", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜溜？」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0119", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为啥你们会脸红啊？」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0368", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没没没没没什么！」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2165", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是暖气有点开过头了吧……」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「需要我去调整一下吗？我去调一下！」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「需要我去调整一下吗？我去调一下！」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2166", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2167", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到害羞地跑出去的安洁，我也渐渐脸红了起来。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "看到害羞地跑出去的安洁，我也渐渐脸红了起来。", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "马上就要迎来期末考试的最后一天，我的心情越来越按耐不住了。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "马上就要迎来期末考试的最后一天，我的心情越来越按耐不住了。", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好奇怪……」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1003", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有点奇怪呢～」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0369", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我反而感觉今天有些冷呢」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4094", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有火热的年轻人在，暖气也没那么必要了。还真是环保呢，呵呵」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "「有火热的年轻人在，暖气也没那么必要了。还真是环保呢，呵呵」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0429", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4095", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐，我们也不能输！来一起贯彻环保省电的精神吧！」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": "「美羽学姐，我们也不能输！来一起贯彻环保省电的精神吧！」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0380", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜溜溜？」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0120", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（我看了看濑名同学和熊喵）虽然大家似乎都觉得有什么事情要发生，但……", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "（我看了看濑名同学和熊喵）虽然大家似乎都觉得有什么事情要发生，但……", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「♪♪」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇哈哈哈，这家伙居然在装蠢」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0370", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我无视了他的话。某种意义上来说，这也是恋爱中的男生所特有的优越感吧。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "我无视了他的话。某种意义上来说，这也是恋爱中的男生所特有的优越感吧。", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我正是因此态度才会转变如此之快，恋爱……真的是一种罪过也说不定。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "但是，我正是因此态度才会转变如此之快，恋爱……真的是一种罪过也说不定。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎样，时间在一点一滴地接近。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那一天大概会成为我们的纪念日吧。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不任由欲望冲动行事，而是像这样一步一步向前迈进——", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "不任由欲望冲动行事，而是像这样一步一步向前迈进——", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如此这般，正因为将“那一天”看的无比重要，所以在那之前的一分一秒都会让我们的氛围更上一层楼。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "如此这般，正因为将“那一天”看的无比重要，所以在那之前的一分一秒都会让我们的氛围更上一层楼。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
